        <briefdescription>
<para>Produce the next value for <ref refid="classiceberg_1_1Stream_1afeb4619594df4cee9df2c4236f017e04" kindref="member">Next()</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Implementations must return std::nullopt when exhausted. <ref refid="classiceberg_1_1Stream_1afeb4619594df4cee9df2c4236f017e04" kindref="member">Next()</ref> makes the terminal state sticky, so implementations are not called after exhaustion or error. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
